Error [E0003]: a Result handler needs a `!` failure branch
  --> tests/ui/result_handler_missing_failure.jet:2:21
    |
  2 |     value ? ok -> ok
    |                     ^
 Why: the compact handler is exhaustive: it has one success branch and one failure branch
 Fix: add `! error -> failure` after the success branch
